# ── pebbl live store (pebbl-history/live) ─────────────────────────────────────
# ~/pebbl/.pebbl symlinks here, so this is a WORKING store, not an archive.
# events.jsonl is the canonical append-only record; everything else pebbl
# generates from it is derived and would only add churn (and binary diffs) to
# the history. These are the same paths `pebbl init` writes into a project's
# .gitignore — kept in step with src/init.js on purpose.
pebbl-history/live/db.sqlite
pebbl-history/live/view.sqlite
pebbl-history/live/manual-logs.md
pebbl-history/live/handoffs.md
pebbl-history/live/commit-log.md
pebbl-history/live/narrative.md
pebbl-history/live/events-view.md
pebbl-history/live/events.local.jsonl
pebbl-history/live/*.lock
pebbl-history/live/.rebuild-needed

# The ARCHIVED store (pebbl-history/archive-*) is deliberately NOT listed here.
# It is a legacy-mode store with no events.jsonl, so its db.sqlite IS the
# canonical record and its .md files are the only readable form. Frozen, so it
# never churns.

.DS_Store
